flowchart TD
  Sources[Five pinned official input releases] --> Diagnosis[MedEinst: 300 native pairs plus 59 auxiliary native pairs]
  Sources --> FourWay[MedEinst: 60 frozen four-way pairs, sensitivity only]
  Sources --> Multi[MedPIC: 467 native multi-select rows, no official pair map]
  Sources --> Choice[CPV: 60 groups and Cultural: 150 groups, native options]
  Sources --> World[MedCounterFact: 80 groups, mandatory article evidence]
  Diagnosis --> Prepare[Task preparation and exact visible-input deduplication]
  FourWay --> Prepare
  Multi --> Prepare
  Choice --> Prepare
  World --> Prepare
  Prepare --> Tasks[Independent question + all options + mandatory evidence]
  Prepare --> Labels[Separate gold, source mapping and frozen taxonomy]
  Tasks --> M0[Direct Llama reader]
  Tasks --> Retrieval[Textbooks and Wikipedia BM25: 32 per source]
  Retrieval --> Rank[MedCPT rerank: initial 5 documents]
  Rank --> M1[Retrieval-only Llama reader]
  Rank --> Summary[KGCC: 5 Llama summaries]
  Summary --> Explore[3 missing knowledge points]
  Explore --> Generate[5 Llama complementary documents]
  Generate --> KADS[Original KADS: select up to 5 from 10]
  Rank --> KADS
  KADS --> FinalRank[MedCPT final reranking]
  FinalRank --> M2[MedRGAG Llama reader]
  Tasks --> M1
  Tasks --> M2
  M0 --> Eval[Offline native scoring and source-group paired analysis]
  M1 --> Eval
  M2 --> Eval
  Labels --> Eval
  Eval --> Domains[Clinical update / invariance / hypothetical evidence world reported separately]
